{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蔚來集團七月的新車交付量接近3.6萬輛。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">按年增長七成一，按月跌一成一。累計今年首七個月，交付量22.7萬輛，按年增長六成八。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-03T02:19:06.912319+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":63,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}